---
title: Orange soup
category: Starters
diet:
  - vegetarian
  - gluten-free
tags:
  - comfort
  - soup
servings: 2
difficulty: Easy
cook time: 10 minutes
created: 2026-06-21
updated: 2026-06-21
---

In a #small saucepan{}, heat @water{300%ml}, @cherry tomatoes{6} cut into quarters, @parsley or coriander{1%sprig}(roughly chopped), @garlic{1%clove}, and @olive oil{1%Tbsp}.

Bring the soup to boil then turn off the heat and allow it to cool until tepid.

In the meantime, cut @oranges{2} into supremes.

Also cut @bread{4%slices}(toasted) into chunks.

> Toast the bread in the oven together with a clove of garlic for aroma.

Discard the garlic, ladle the soup into a bowl, then add the orange segments and bread. Season with @fine sea salt{}, @black pepper{}(freshly ground), and drizzle with oil.